{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u5927\u6807\u9898\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u5267\u60c5\u7b80\u4ecb\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" />Grey is an ordinary young man living in a rural town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the invitation of a fellow townsman, he traveled to the capital, Rivera, to participate in a months-long study exchange program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, on his very first night in Rivera, he had a strange dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the dream, a group of people wearing eerie masks seemed to be plotting an assassination attempt on the king...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 The next day, news broke that the king was indeed attacked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should Grey use the information he had to help those who were innocently harmed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or should he stay out of trouble and keep his distance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And most importantly\u2014was what he saw that night truly just a dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6545\u4e8b\u80cc\u666f\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story takes place in the fictional country of Merya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is an era of booming industrial development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Electricity is widespread, factory assembly lines roar around the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock codes scroll ceaselessly on towering billboards, and city center streets are packed with cars...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet no one notices that the glass-clad skyscrapers cast shadows large enough to engulf the entire city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u89d2\u8272\u4ecb\u7ecd\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u7070\u807f\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u57c3\u6cd5\u5c14\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/CP\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u57fa\u7840\u4fe1\u606f\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Title</strong>: Halloween Eye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Initial Platform</strong>: Steam (PC)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Script Length</strong>: Over 500,000 words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Illustration Count</strong>: Over 300 CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ending Count</strong>: More than 10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voice Acting</strong>: Fully English Dubbed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime</strong>: Over 20 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620f\u7279\u8272\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 500,000 words of story content, featuring more than 10 different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully designed choices that allow players to experience vastly different story branches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620f\u7279\u8272\u56fe\u7247\uff08\u82f1\uff091.png?t=1743555912\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620f\u7279\u8272\u56fe\u7247\uff08\u82f1\uff092.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 300 full-color CGs (excluding variants).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 hand-drawn background illustrations (excluding variants).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620fCG\u56fe\u7247\uff08\u82f1\uff091.png?t=1743555912\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620fCG\u56fe\u7247\uff08\u82f1\uff092.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 100 uniquely illustrated characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620f\u89d2\u8272\u56fe\u7247\uff08\u901a\u7528\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A sleek, user-friendly, and feature-rich UI.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620f\u754c\u9762\u56fe\u7247\uff08\u82f1\uff091.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620f\u754c\u9762\u56fe\u7247\uff08\u82f1\uff092.png?t=1743555912\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6e38\u620f\u754c\u9762\u56fe\u7247\uff08\u82f1\uff093.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full English voiceover for an enhanced immersive experience.</p><p clas