am.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, on his very first night in Rivera, he had a strange dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the dream, a group of people wearing eerie masks seemed to be plotting an assassination attempt on the king...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 The next day, news broke that the king was indeed attacked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should Grey use the information he had to help those who were innocently harmed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or should he stay out of trouble and keep his distance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And most importantly\u2014was what he saw that night truly just a dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u6545\u4e8b\u80cc\u666f\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story takes place in the fictional country of Merya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is an era of booming industrial development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Electricity is widespread, factory assembly lines roar around the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock codes scroll ceaselessly on towering billboards, and city center streets are packed with cars...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet no one notices that the glass-clad skyscrapers cast shadows large enough to engulf the entire city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u89d2\u8272\u4ecb\u7ecd\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u7070\u807f\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619360/extras/\u57c3\u6cd5\u5c14\uff08\u82f1\uff09.png?t=1743555912\" /><img c