 Eye is a text-based adventure game set in a modern alternate-history city with light fantasy elements. Through the perspective of the protagonist, Grey, players will witness the kindness and harshness of human nature, as well as the evolution and fate of the city.","steam_appid":3619360,"support_info":{"email":"circuit110@163.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}